{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is B-connected to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":", or some hyperedge with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" among its targets is entered along a path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" is a vertex."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Precondition"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L318"},"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Hypergraphs"}],"title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6Vertex